  (text "No MCU or +3V3 supply dependency. Comparator/reference/push-pull gate drive are supplied from ACT_5V.\nNominal hysteresis near 5.98V ON / 5.72V OFF; see wheel checks for tolerance corners.\nFour parallel 47R/2W resistors = 11.75 ohms; about 3.1W ON at 6V. D2 remains the secondary transient clamp."
    (at 20 34 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "2a1cc67a-c06c-553d-8d21-eac87d746853"))
  (text "PROVISIONAL ENERGY ENVELOPE: characterize at <=0.5W average returned power with temperature monitoring.\nResistor ratings are not enclosed-board thermal acceptance. Verify unpowered-MCU braking, startup and overshoot."
    (at 20 272 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "be2d812c-3159-55ea-b4aa-6bf77937d3ce"))
  (embedded_fonts no))
